{"id":"n89849-1-5","stage":2,"title":"그리 · 往那里","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89849-1-5-1","ko":"이쪽으로 오셔서 저 좀 도와주시겠어요?","zh":"能请您到这边来帮我一下吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이쪽으로","meaning":"这边，这位","explanation":"이쪽：这边，这位；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이쪽","audio":"/audio/ceea9a2e61410973dfd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71694","senseId":"3","lemma":"이쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이쪽으로","audio":"/audio/bc86003914714bd63db7.mp3"}},{"text":"오셔서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오셔서","audio":"/audio/ffd1b4d099e08d8cf2cd.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"도와주시겠어요?","meaning":"帮，帮助；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와주시겠어요","a